---
import stories from '../data/stories.json';
import AgentJourney from '../components/AgentJourney.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="Persistent coding agents on your computer. Editable files, scheduled work and Git history. Open-source Gum Drops." /><title>Gum Drops · Agents with a place to call home</title></head>
<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/">Gum Drops</a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#journey">Your team</a><a href="#stories">Roadmap</a><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops">GitHub ↗</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div><h1>The always-on agent that works for you, not them.</h1><p class="intro">Built on <a href="https://pi.dev/">Pi</a> and fully open source.</p><pre class="hero-install" aria-label="Install Gum Drops"><code>npm i -g gumdrops
gumdrops setup</code></pre></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 110"><defs>
<linearGradient id="gumdrop-body" x1=".2" y1="0" x2=".8" y2="1"><stop stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".52"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".06"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="white" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#30142e" stop-opacity=".46"/></linearGradient>
<radialGradient id="gumdrop-glow" cx=".28" cy=".22" r=".75"><stop stop-color="white" stop-opacity=".38"/><stop offset=".65" stop-color="white" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<radialGradient id="gumdrop-shadow"><stop stop-color="#302037" stop-opacity=".22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#302037" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<pattern id="gumdrop-sugar" width="9" height="11" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M2 2l1.1 -.5 .6 1.3 -1 .6z" fill="white" opacity=".28"/><circle cx="7" cy="8" r=".65" fill="white" opacity=".38"/><circle cx="3" cy="9" r=".45" fill="#7e481b" opacity=".15"/></pattern>
<path id="gumdrop-shape" d="M20 85 C12 82 14 74 18 60 C24 37 31 17 50 17 C69 17 76 37 82 60 C86 74 88 82 80 85 C64 92 36 92 20 85Z"/>
</defs><ellipse cx="50" cy="98" rx="34" ry="6" fill="url(#gumdrop-shadow)"/>
<g class="character"><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="#f0a323"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-body)"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-glow)"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="none" stroke="#42233a" stroke-opacity=".14"/><use href="#gumdrop-shape" fill="url(#gumdrop-sugar)"/>
<path d="M29 46 C31 33 39 24 47 24 C54 24 50 30 43 33 C36 37 34 50 29 46Z" fill="white" opacity=".35"/><path d="M24 81 C40 86 61 86 76 81" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-opacity=".23" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<g transform="translate(0 8)"><ellipse cx="33" cy="60" rx="5" ry="2.3" fill="#f74776" opacity=".22"/><ellipse cx="67" cy="60" rx="5" ry="2.3" fill="#f74776" opacity=".22"/><g fill="#292033"><rect x="37" y="44.5" width="6.5" height="13" rx="3.25"/><rect x="56.5" y="44.5" width="6.5" height="13" rx="3.25"/></g><g fill="white" opacity=".8"><circle cx="39.3" cy="46.5" r="1"/><circle cx="58.8" cy="46.5" r="1"/></g></g></g></svg></div></section>
    <section class="agent-folder" id="how" aria-labelledby="folder-heading">
      <div class="folder-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Plain files. Your agent.</p><h2 id="folder-heading">An agent is just a folder.</h2><p>Start with <code>AGENT.md</code>. Give it a role, choose its settings and add a schedule if it needs one. Everything else is optional.</p><p>Memory keeps notes between runs. Skills add instructions for specific jobs. MCP connects tools and services. Add only what your agent needs.</p><p>Edit the files yourself or let the agent update them. Gum Drops reads the definition from disk on its next run.</p><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops/blob/main/docs/agent-definitions.md">Read the agent format ↗</a></div>
      <div class="folder-panel"><div class="folder-panel__bar"><span>release-manager/</span><span class="file-tag">Agent folder</span></div><pre class="folder-tree" aria-label="Agent files. AGENT.md is required. Memory, MCP servers and skills are optional."><code><span class="tree-root">release-manager/</span>
├── <span class="tree-file">AGENT.md</span> <span class="tree-required">[required]</span>
│   <span class="tree-note">Role, model and schedule</span>
├── <span class="tree-file">memory.md</span> <span class="tree-optional">[optional]</span>
│   <span class="tree-note">Notes between runs</span>
├── <span class="tree-file">mcp.json</span> <span class="tree-optional">[optional]</span>
│   <span class="tree-note">Tools and services</span>
└── <span class="tree-file">skills/</span> <span class="tree-optional">[optional]</span>
    └── release-check/
        └── <span class="tree-file">SKILL.md</span>
            <span class="tree-note">Instructions for a job</span></code></pre><p class="folder-panel__note">Lives in ~/.gumdrops/agents/ or your project's .gumdrops/agents/.</p></div>
    </section>
    <AgentJourney />
    <section class="system-agents" aria-labelledby="system-agents-title">
      <div class="system-agents-heading"><h2 id="system-agents-title">System sub agents</h2><p>Give your agents access to the coding tools installed on your computer, with custom instructions for when to use each.</p></div>
      <div class="system-agents-grid">
        <article class="system-agent"><span class="runner-mark claude-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logos/claude.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" /></span><div><h3>Claude</h3></div></article>
        <article class="system-agent"><span class="runner-mark codex-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logos/codex.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" /></span><div><h3>Codex</h3></div></article>
        <article class="system-agent"><span class="runner-mark cursor-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logos/cursor.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" /></span><div><h3>Cursor</h3></div></article>
        <article class="system-agent"><span class="runner-mark antigravity-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logos/antigravity.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" /></span><div><h3>Antigravity</h3></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="stories" class="stories"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Upvote what we should build next</h2></div></div><div class="roadmap-table-wrap"><table class="roadmap-table"><caption class="sr-only">Proposed features and GitHub upvotes</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Story</th><th scope="col">What it adds</th><th scope="col">Upvotes</th><th scope="col">Have your say</th></tr></thead><tbody>{stories.map(story => <tr><th scope="row"><span class="eyebrow">{story.category}</span><span class="roadmap-title">{story.title}</span></th><td>{story.description}</td><td><span class="vote-count" data-issue={story.url.split('/').pop()} aria-label={`${story.upvotes} saved thumbs-up reactions`}>{story.upvotes}</span></td><td><a class="story-vote" href={story.url}>Vote on GitHub ↗</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
    <section id="install" class="install"><div><h2>The always-on agent that works for you.</h2></div><div><pre><code>npm i -g gumdrops
gumdrops setup</code></pre><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops#install">Installation & documentation ↗</a></div></section>
  </main><footer><span>Gum Drops · Open source</span><a href="https://github.com/AM1010101/gum-drops">Code, issues & contributions ↗</a></footer>

<script>
const counts = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.vote-count');
await Promise.allSettled(Array.from(counts, async element => {
  try {
    const response = await fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/AM1010101/gum-drops/issues/${element.dataset.issue}`, { headers: { Accept: 'application/vnd.github+json' }, signal: AbortSignal.timeout(8000) });
    if (!response.ok) throw new Error('GitHub unavailable');
    const issue = await response.json();
    const count = issue.reactions?.['+1'];
    if (!Number.isInteger(count) || count < 0) throw new Error('Missing reaction count');
    element.textContent = String(count);
    element.setAttribute('aria-label', `${count} thumbs-up reactions`);
  } catch {
    element.setAttribute('title', 'Saved count. Live refresh unavailable.');
    throw new Error('Count unavailable');
  }
}));
</script>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:#fbf7f0;color:#342c33;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;line-height:1.65}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}header,main,footer{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}header{padding:32px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.brand{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}nav{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:14px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:65px 40px 95px;gap:40px}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#947565}h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-2px}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,76px);margin:24px 0}h2{font-size:44px;margin:16px 0 40px}h3{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px;line-height:1.25}.intro{font-size:18px;max-width:510px;color:#74676b}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin:30px 0}.button{background:#3c303b;color:#fff;padding:13px 23px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}.small{font-size:12px;color:#85787c}.hero-art{background:#f5e8dc;border-radius:48% 48% 38% 38%;padding:38px;position:relative;text-align:center}.hero-art svg{width:100%;max-width:350px}.art-note{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a6d74}.character{transform-origin:50px 87px;animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes breathe{50%{transform:rotate(3deg) scale(1.01,.99)}}section{scroll-margin-top:24px}.principles{padding:70px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e5dcd4}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px}.columns p{font-size:15px;color:#786b70}.columns article>span{color:#bd9484;font-size:12px}.stories{padding:60px 40px;background:#f2ebe3;border-radius:20px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px}.section-heading>p{max-width:310px;color:#786b70;font-size:14px}.story{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fffaf4;padding:26px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e9ddd3}.story>p:not(.eyebrow){flex:1}.story-vote{align-self:flex-start;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d6bdb3;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 14px;color:#573e49;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:13px}.count{margin-left:14px}.story-vote:hover{background:#f8e1e8}.story-vote:disabled{opacity:.7;cursor:default}.install{padding:95px 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.install p{max-width:430px;color:#786b70}pre{background:#352c35;color:#fae9d6;border-radius:12px;padding:26px;line-height:2;overflow:auto}code{font-family:monospace}footer{padding:28px 40px;border-top:1px solid #e5dcd4;font-size:12px;color:#85787c;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #be4270;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:24px}nav{gap:14px;font-size:12px}nav a:first-child{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:36px 24px 60px}.hero-art{max-width:360px;width:100%;margin:auto}.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2{font-size:34px}.principles,.stories{padding:40px 24px}.stories{border-radius:0}.section-heading{display:block}.install{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:60px 24px;gap:10px}footer{padding:24px;gap:24px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.character{animation:none}}
.principles-columns{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.agent-folder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;padding:40px 40px 85px;align-items:center}.folder-copy h2{margin-bottom:24px}.folder-copy p{color:#786b70;font-size:15px}.folder-copy a{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:14px}.folder-panel{background:#352c35;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;color:#fae9d6}.folder-panel__bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff12;font-size:13px}.file-tag{font-size:10px;color:#cfbac5}.folder-tree{margin:0;padding:24px;background:transparent;line-height:1.8;font-size:13px;border-radius:0}.tree-root{color:#efbd8c}.tree-file{color:#fff3e6}.tree-required{color:#a9d9b5;font-size:10px}.tree-optional{color:#c4b5c0;font-size:10px}.tree-note{color:#b9a6b2;font-size:11px}.folder-panel__note{font-size:11px;color:#c4b5c0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff12;padding:16px 24px;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:760px){.agent-folder{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:30px 24px 60px;gap:24px}.principles-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.folder-tree{font-size:12px;padding:20px}.folder-panel__bar{padding:16px 20px}}
.roadmap-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;background:#fffaf4;border:1px solid #e9ddd3;border-radius:12px}.roadmap-table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:14px}.roadmap-table th,.roadmap-table td{padding:22px;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #e9ddd3}.roadmap-table thead th{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#947565;background:#f9f2ea}.roadmap-table tbody tr:last-child>*{border-bottom:0}.roadmap-table tbody th{width:27%;font-weight:500}.roadmap-title{display:block;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;margin-top:8px}.roadmap-table td:nth-child(2){color:#786b70;width:40%}.vote-count{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700}.roadmap-table .story-vote{display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:760px){.roadmap-table{min-width:650px}.roadmap-table th,.roadmap-table td{padding:16px}}
.hero-install{max-width:510px;margin:24px 0 0;padding:18px 22px;font-size:13px}.intro a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.system-agents{padding:55px 40px 70px;border-top:1px solid #e5dcd4}.system-agents-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:36px;margin-bottom:26px}.system-agents-heading h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0}.system-agents-heading p{max-width:340px;margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#786b70}.system-agents-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.system-agent{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:20px 16px;background:#fffaf4;border:1px solid #e9ddd3;border-radius:14px}.runner-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.5px}.claude-mark{background:transparent}.codex-mark{background:transparent}.cursor-mark{background:transparent}.antigravity-mark{background:transparent}.system-agent h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;letter-spacing:-.4px}.system-agent p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#786b70}.runner-status{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:10px;color:#947565;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:1000px){.system-agents-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:760px){.system-agents{padding:36px 24px 46px}.system-agents-heading{display:block}.system-agents-heading p{margin-top:14px}.system-agent{padding:16px 12px;gap:10px}.runner-mark{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:12px}.system-agent h3{font-size:16px}}
.runner-mark img{display:block;width:36px;height:36px}.system-agent h3{margin:0}
</style>
</body></html>
